  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Historical UML class diagram of the 3T-SBOM group's draft core model (circa September 2020). Identity (Id, name, aliases, comment), specialised by Tool (user-agent), Organization and Person (a Person may belong to 0..1 Organization), is linked to Artifact (Id, artifact-url, name, comment) as supplier and as originator (each 0..1); a callout reads 'Need to capture contacts on supplier and originator links'. Artifact has Hashes (algorithm, value), ExternalReferences (type, locator, comment) and takes part in Relationship (type, completeness, comment) as from and to. DocumentMetadata has creators (1..* Identity); a Tool links to 0..1 ExternalDocumentReference (namespace, document-url, comment) by 'bill-of-materials', and that reference carries Hashes.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01VfkKocGaQW7Msro2t5S66U"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-03",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagramme de classes UML historique du modèle Core provisoire du groupe 3T-SBOM (vers septembre 2020). Identity (Id, name, aliases, comment), spécialisée par Tool (user-agent), Organization et Person (une Person peut appartenir à 0..1 Organization), est reliée à Artifact (Id, artifact-url, name, comment) comme supplier et comme originator (chacun 0..1) ; une bulle indique « Need to capture contacts on supplier and originator links ». Artifact a des Hashes (algorithm, value) et des ExternalReferences (type, locator, comment), et participe à Relationship (type, completeness, comment) comme from et to. DocumentMetadata a des creators (1..* Identity) ; un Tool est relié à 0..1 ExternalDocumentReference (namespace, document-url, comment) par « bill-of-materials », et cette référence porte des Hashes.",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
